      "date": "2026-10-14 09:30:33.000000000",
      "message": "Patch Set 1: Verified+1\n\nPassed enforced test review-ldiskfs-dne-arm on RHEL 8.10 / x86_64, Rocky 9.8 / aarch64 uploaded by Onyx Autotest from onyx-180vm5: https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_sessions/0f259427-1356-4d05-9813-6dbf42e1164e ran 5 tests.",
